{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "愚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大道，五帝時也。英，俊選之光者。逮，及也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "公，共也。禪聖授聖，〔不〕家之睦親也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈孝之道廣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無匱乏也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隱，猶去也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "傳位於子。傳，文專反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俗狹嗇。為，于偽反。嗇，音色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亂賦繁多，為此以服人也。大人，諸侯也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以其違大道敦朴之本，教令之稠，其弊則然。老子曰：法令滋章，\n盜賊多有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄二餘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "毘曇師名"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中間知界，知色、受、想、行皆結，是名中智；分別諸界有無量相等，是名\n上智等語，例前後可知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上正文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云\n云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄三六紙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上正文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "籤云有覺有觀等三，名別\n義同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄加隨所說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上正文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼疏云：有定共戒為色蘊，餘四可知。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此法指世第一，下同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼指見道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "休論文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牒論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "扇搋\n者，黃門也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "牒論"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上俱舍疏中正文。"}
